      <title>local-mcp exec Tool Sandbox/Restriction Bypass (CVE-2026-6130)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/misc/2026-07-05_cve-2026-6130-local-mcp-exec-sandbox-bypass/</link>
